# EPICS database for zone TESTZ — GENERATED, DO NOT EDIT.
#
#     python ioc/generate.py --zone TESTZ
#
# Built from what each component declares about its PVs
# (`Component.pv_specs()`), so a screen written in YAML gets a
# working IOC with no extra work.
#
# Zone:    TESTZ — Test zone
# Screens: l4-opcpa, chillers, vacuum
#
# Analogue records scan at 1 second and random-walk inside their band;
# their alarm limits are real, so the panel's MINOR and MAJOR arrive
# through the same path as an alarm from the hall.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# l4-opcpa — L4 OPCPA
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
